{% comment %}
  Renders the Farm/Almanac stylesheet + Newsreader serif webfont.

  Inter + IBM Plex Mono are already loaded by the theme (assets/bayou-custom.css
  + theme font settings); only Newsreader is missing, so we add it here. The
  fonts + farm.css load only on templates that render a farm-* section — no
  global stylesheet change to layout/theme.liquid.

  Every farm-* section includes this snippet at its top. If multiple farm-*
  sections render on one page the browser de-duplicates the identical asset
  URLs, so emitting it per-section is safe and keeps each section
  self-contained / independently usable in the customizer.

  Usage: {% render 'farm-head' %}
{% endcomment %}
{% comment %}
  theme-check-disable RemoteAsset
  Google Fonts loaded the same way the theme already loads Inter + IBM Plex Mono
  in layout/theme.liquid. Only the Newsreader serif (used for the editorial
  accents) is added here, on Farm templates only.
{% endcomment %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link
  rel="stylesheet"
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400..700;1,6..72,400..600&display=swap"
  media="print"
  onload="this.media='all'"
>
<noscript>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400..700;1,6..72,400..600&display=swap">
</noscript>
{{ 'farm.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{% comment %}theme-check-enable RemoteAsset{% endcomment %}
